{
  "_comment": [
    "Canonical service inventory for the ai-stack health checkers — the single",
    "source of truth for WHAT to check, to stop the three checkers from drifting.",
    "Consumed directly by status_check.py (data-driven liveness loop). The",
    "PowerShell monitor (stack-watchdog.ps1) and quick-fixes.bat keep their",
    "bespoke probe/recovery logic but should be reconciled against this list when",
    "containers are added/removed (alongside compose + recovery scripts + stack-map,",
    "per CLAUDE.md's three-place convention).",
    "",
    "IMPORTANT: 'container' is the docker container NAME (use with `docker inspect`).",
    "For the ai-stack project some compose SERVICE keys differ from container names",
    "(service redis->search-redis, gateway->search-gateway,",
    "— see the 'service' field where it differs.",
    "Open Brain is a SEPARATE compose project (open-brain); a plain `docker compose`",
    "from the ai-stack dir cannot see it — probe its containers by name.",
    "",
    "MACHINE-VERIFIED since 2026-08-22 (D-12): the pre-commit check",
    "(check-project-configs.ps1) diffs every (container -> project) row against",
    "the rendered compose configs - the inventory can no longer drift silently.",
    "Curated fields (critical / host_health / notes) remain hand-owned."
  ],
  "projects": {
    "ai-stack": {
      "compose": "docker compose"
    },
    "open-brain": {
      "compose": "docker compose -f OB1/docker/docker-compose.yml"
    }
  },
  "planes": {
    "core": [
      {
        "container": "openwebui",
        "project": "frontend",
        "critical": true,
        "host_health": "http://127.0.0.1:3000/health"
      },
      {
        "container": "tailscale",
        "project": "frontend",
        "critical": true
      },
      {
        "container": "llm-gateway",
        "project": "inference",
        "critical": true,
        "note": "LiteLLM front door (holds the llama-cpp / llama-cpp-embed aliases). No host_health: llm-net is internal so host :4000 is inert; liveliness is in-network (http://llm-gateway:8080/health/liveliness)."
      },
      {
        "container": "llm-gateway-db",
        "project": "inference",
        "critical": true,
        "note": "Postgres spend-log ledger backing llm-gateway."
      },
      {
        "container": "llama-cpp-upstream",
        "project": "inference",
        "critical": true,
        "host_health": "http://127.0.0.1:8081/health"
      },
      {
        "container": "llama-cpp-embed-upstream",
        "project": "inference",
        "critical": false,
        "host_health": "http://127.0.0.1:8082/health"
      },
      {
        "container": "llm-queue",
        "project": "inference",
        "critical": true,
        "note": "B2 admission controller between LiteLLM and the upstreams (llm-backend-net only; liveness via docker exec /healthz)"
      },
      {
        "container": "llm-gateway-ui",
        "project": "inference",
        "critical": false,
        "note": "Admin-UI sidecar (tailnet :8445/ui + litellm.devinveller.ai); serves no inference"
      }
    ],
    "memory": [
      {
        "container": "mnemory",
        "project": "memory",
        "critical": false
      },
      {
        "container": "mnemory-cloud-gateway",
        "project": "memory",
        "critical": false
      }
    ],
    "search": [
